      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Industry Leadership')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Industry Leadership</div><div class="achieve-sub">The most respected name in your category</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Innovation Pioneer')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Innovation Pioneer</div><div class="achieve-sub">Setting trends that the rest of your industry follows</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Strategic Acquisitions')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Strategic Acquisitions</div><div class="achieve-sub">Inorganic growth through well-chosen acquisitions</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Exceptional Brand Equity')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Exceptional Brand Equity</div><div class="achieve-sub">A brand customers seek out without being told</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Dominant Market Share')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Dominant Market Share</div><div class="achieve-sub">A defensible position in your core segments</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Enduring Legacy')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Enduring Legacy</div><div class="achieve-sub">A business built to outlast its founder</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','IPO or Strategic Exit')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">IPO or Strategic Exit</div><div class="achieve-sub">A liquidity event that rewards your years of building</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Meaningful Social Impact')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Meaningful Social Impact</div><div class="achieve-sub">A business that is measurably good for the world</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card" onclick="toggleAchieve(this,'y5achieve','Operational Excellence')">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div><div class="achieve-label">Operational Excellence</div><div class="achieve-sub">Systems, margins and quality that set the benchmark</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="achieve-card achieve-card-other" onclick="toggleAchieveOther(this)">
        <div class="achieve-check"><svg width="11" height="9" viewBox="0 0 11 9" fill="none"><path d="M1 4.5L4 7.5L10 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div style="width:100%"><div class="achieve-label">Something Else</div>
          <div id="y5achieve-other-wrap" style="display:none;margin-top:8px;">
            <input class="field-input" style="font-size:13px;padding:10px 12px;" placeholder="What achievement would you add?" oninput="state.otherAnswers.y5achieve=this.value;">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <label class="field-label">If a leading business publication featured your company five years from now, what would the headline say?</label>
    <textarea class="big-area" id="f-headline" placeholder="e.g. How Apex Industries became the only Indian manufacturer to supply Airbus and Boeing simultaneously" rows="2"></textarea>
    <div class="q-nav" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <button class="btn-back" onclick="goBack()">Back</button>
      <button class="btn-next" onclick="nextScreen()">Continue <svg style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:4px;" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     SCREEN 9: FOUNDER
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="screen q-wrap" id="screen-founder">
  <div class="q-inner">
    <div class="q-section">The Founder</div>
    <h2 class="q-heading">What kind of leader do you want to become over the next five years?</h2>
    <p class="q-sub">The businesses that endure are built by founders who invest in their own growth alongside the company's. <span class="opt">Select up to two.</span></p>
    <div class="cards-grid c4" id="grid-founder" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Visionary Leader')"><div class="ccard-label">Visionary Leader</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Master Delegator')"><div class="ccard-label">Master Delegator</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Industry Expert')"><div class="ccard-label">Industry Expert</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Innovator')"><div class="ccard-label">Innovator</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Global Entrepreneur')"><div class="ccard-label">Global Entrepreneur</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Thought Leader')"><div class="ccard-label">Thought Leader</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Investor')"><div class="ccard-label">Investor</div></div>
      <div class="ccard" onclick="toggleFounderCard(this,'Mentor')"><div class="ccard-label">Mentor</div></div>
      <div class="ccard other-card" onclick="toggleFounderCardOther(this)"><div class="ccard-label">Other</div><div class="other-reveal" id="other-founder"><input class="field-input" style="margin-top:6px;" placeholder="Describe the leader you want to be" oninput="state.otherAnswers.founder=this.value;"></div></div>
    </div>
    <label class="field-label">Which area of the business deserves your deepest focus right now? <span class="opt">Select up to two.</span></label>
    <div class="chip-row" id="chips-focus" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Sales & Marketing')">Sales & Marketing</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Finance & Profitability')">Finance & Profitability</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Operations')">Operations</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Technology')">Technology</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'People & Culture')">People & Culture</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Customer Experience')">Customer Experience</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Innovation')">Innovation</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleFocusChip(this,'Brand')">Brand</div>
    </div>
    <label class="field-label">Outside of business, what would a successful five years look like for you personally? <span class="opt">(Optional)</span></label>
    <div class="chip-row" id="chips-personal">
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Family Time')">Family Time</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Health & Fitness')">Health & Fitness</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Travel')">Travel</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Financial Freedom')">Financial Freedom</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Learning')">Learning</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Giving Back')">Giving Back</div>
      <div class="chip" onclick="toggleChip(this,'personal','Time Freedom')">Time Freedom</div>
    </div>
    <div class="q-nav" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <button class="btn-back" onclick="goBack()">Back</button>
      <button class="btn-next" onclick="nextScreen()">Continue <svg style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:4px;" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     SCREEN 10: READY
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="screen q-wrap" id="screen-contact">
  <div class="q-inner" style="text-align:center;max-width:560px;">
    <div class="q-section">Your Blueprint is Almost Ready</div>
    <h2 class="q-heading">You have built a complete strategic picture.</h2>
    <p class="q-sub">Click below to generate your personalised Growth Blueprint. Your responses and AI-generated strategy will be saved so you can review or download them at any time.</p>
    <div style="margin:32px 0;">
      <svg width="56" height="56" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="q-nav q-nav-final">
      <button class="btn-back" onclick="goBack()">Back</button>
      <button class="btn-generate" onclick="runGenerate()">
        Generate My Blueprint
        <svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     SCREEN: GENERATING
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="screen" id="screen-generating" style="background:var(--navy);align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:60px 24px;">
  <div>
    <div style="width:40px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);margin:0 auto 36px;opacity:0.6;"></div>
    <h2 class="gen-title">Building Your Growth Blueprint</h2>
    <p class="gen-sub">Analysing your responses and crafting your personalised strategy board</p>
    <div class="gen-list" id="gen-list">
      <div class="gen-item" id="gi-1"><div class="gen-dot"></div>Analysing your business profile</div>
      <div class="gen-item" id="gi-2"><div class="gen-dot"></div>Crafting your strategic roadmap</div>
      <div class="gen-item" id="gi-3"><div class="gen-dot"></div>Generating AI insights and priorities</div>
      <div class="gen-item" id="gi-4"><div class="gen-dot"></div>Writing your mission and vision</div>
      <div class="gen-item" id="gi-5"><div class="gen-dot"></div>Composing your Vision Board</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     SCREEN: BOARD
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="screen" id="screen-board" style="flex-direction:column;">
  <div class="board-topbar">
    <div class="board-topbar-left">
      <div class="board-topbar-co" id="tb-company">Growth Blueprint</div>
      <div class="board-topbar-sub" id="tb-sub">Strategic Vision Board</div>
    </div>
    <div class="board-topbar-center">
      <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--slate);white-space:nowrap;">Growth Partner</span>
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Dev Mantra" style="height:28px;">
    </div>
    <div class="board-topbar-right">
      <button class="btn-tb" onclick="showCongrats()">Share</button>
      <button class="btn-tb primary" id="btn-download" onclick="exportBoard()">Download PDF</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="layout-tabs">
    <button class="ltab on" onclick="setLayout('executive',this)">Executive</button>
    <button class="ltab" onclick="setLayout('magazine',this)">Magazine</button>
  </div>
  <div class="board-area">
    <div id="board-render-area" class="bl-executive"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="board-footer"></div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     SCREEN: CONGRATS
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="screen" id="screen-congrats" style="background:var(--navy);align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:80px 24px;">
  <div>
    <div class="cgrats-rule"></div>
    <h2 class="cgrats-h">Congratulations,<br><span id="cgrats-name">Founder</span>.</h2>
    <p class="cgrats-body">You have just completed a strategic growth planning exercise that many business leaders never take the time to do.<br><br>Your personalised Business Growth Blueprint and Vision Board are ready. Use it to align your leadership team, guide key decisions, measure progress, and build the future you envision.</p>
    <button class="btn-view-board" onclick="showBoard()">
      View Your Vision Board
      <svg width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Export overlay -->
<div id="export-overlay">
  <div>
    <div style="width:36px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);margin:0 auto 28px;opacity:0.6;"></div>
    <div class="export-msg">Generating your PDF</div>
    <div class="export-sub">This may take a moment — please wait</div>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="module" src="{{ asset('assets/vision-card/js/main.js') }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
